# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum also documents these addons itself, mirrored here: [SQD](/addons/qiskit-addon-sqd), [OBP](/addons/qiskit-addon-obp), [PNA](/addons/qiskit-addon-pna), [SLC](/addons/qiskit-addon-slc). All addons: [Advanced techniques - Qiskit addons](/guides/addons).\n"
msgstr "IBM Quantum은 다음 애드온도 직접 문서화하며, 여기에 미러링되어 있어요. [SQD](/addons/qiskit-addon-sqd), [OBP](/addons/qiskit-addon-obp), [PNA](/addons/qiskit-addon-pna), [SLC](/addons/qiskit-addon-slc). 모든 애드온은 [고급 기법 - Qiskit 애드온](/guides/addons)에서 볼 수 있어요.\n"
